# INVWINSX.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:SPLIT255.CFG (TEST/WIN/SPLIT255.CFG, WINSPLIT=255): a tree wider
# than the frame, held so that the contents keep their least width, on
# the frame as it opens and maximized.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINSX.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/splitchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ALT-SPACE X
S MAX
K ALT-F X
